WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:10.076
&gt;&gt;&gt; WELCOME BACK EVERYONE.
ELECON OFFICIALS IN GILLESPE,

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:13.480
TEXAS, LEAVING THEIR POST IN THE
LEAD-UP TO TOMORROW'S ELECTION.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:17.483
WHO IS LEFT IN CHARGE?
ELECTION PRECINCT JUDGE WHO

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:20.854
DOESN'T ACCEPT THE RESULTS OF
THE 2020 PRESIDENTIAL CONTEST.

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:25.925
CNN'S ED LAVANDERA REPORTS NOW.
&gt;&gt; THIS IS THE AUCTION BARN MOST

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:29.028
OF THE TIME.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: ON ELECTION DAY,

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:33.133
DAVID TRANSCRIBES WILL BE HERE
SERVING THE VOTERS OF PRECINCT

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:37.904
13 IN GILLESPIE COUNTY, TEXAS.
&gt;&gt; YOU HAVE AN OFFICIAL TITLE

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:42.041
IN.
&gt;&gt; YES, ELECTION JUDGE.

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:46.946
&gt;&gt; Reporter: ELECTION PRECINCT
JUDGE USUALLY WOULDN'T RAISE ANY

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:48.882
EYEBROWS.
&gt;&gt; YOU BELIEVE THE 2020 ELECTION

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:51.551
WAS STOLEN FROM DONALD TRUMP?
&gt;&gt; YES, I DO.

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:55.221
&gt;&gt; WHY SHOULD SOMEONE LIKE YOU
SERVE IN THIS KIND OF OFFICIAL

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:58.925
CAPACITY FOR AN ELECTION?
&gt;&gt; I WOULD THINK I WOULD

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:04.364
PROBABLY BE A GOOD CANDIDATE
BECAUSE I'M GOING TO BE REALLY

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:05.899
KEEN LOOKING FOR ANYTHING THAT
LOOKS WRONG.

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:10.136
MY OBJECTIVE IS INTEGRITY, NOT
THAT MY GUYS WIN, BUT INTEGRITY.

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:13.839
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE STORY OF HOW
GILLESPIE COUNTY REACHED THIS

00:01:13.839 --> 00:01:20.146
POINT IS A CAUTIONARY TALE OF
HOW THE 2020 ELECTION DENYING

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:22.982
CONSPIRACY THEORIES VIRUS KEEPS
SPREADING.

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:28.421
THERE'S NOTHING GLAMOROUS ABOUT
THE GILLESPIE COUNTY ELECTION

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:30.156
ADMINISTRATORS OFFICE.
INSIDE, THE SMALL ELECTION TEAM

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:33.493
DID THEIR WORK.
BY MID AUGUST, ALL THREE

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:36.462
EMPLOYEES HAD QUIT, THREE MONTHS
BEFORE THE MIDTERM ELECTION.

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:40.700
&gt;&gt; THE ELECTION TROUBLE HERE
DATES BACK TO 2019 WHEN A BALLOT

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:43.903
MEASURE ASKED VOTERS WHETHER OR
NOT FLUORIDE SHOULD BE USED IN

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:47.740
THE CITY'S DRINKING WATER.
THE ANTI-FLUORIDE ACTIVIST WHO

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:51.411
LOST, QUESTIONED THE INTEGRITY
OF THAT ELECTION, AND THEN THE

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:55.181
2020 PRESIDENTIAL ELECTION CAME
ALONG POURING GASOLINE ON THE

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:58.851
FLAMES OF ELECTION CONSPIRACY
THEORIES.

00:01:58.851 --> 00:02:02.222
EVEN THOUGH DONALD TRUMP WON
THIS COUNTY WITH 79% OF THE

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:04.457
VOTE, SOME REPUBLICANS WERE
CONVINCED SOMETHING WASN'T

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:07.994
RIGHT.
IN AUGUST OF THIS YEAR, THE

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:12.265
ELECTIONS ADMINISTRATOR, ANISSA
HERRERA WAS DONE.

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:15.602
SHE WROTE THAT THREATS AGAINST
ELECTION OFFICIALS, DANGEROUS

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:19.172
MISINFORMATION, POOR WORKING
CONDITIONS AND ABSURD

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:21.107
LEGISLATION HAVE COMPLETELY
CHANGED HER JOB.

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:25.945
&gt;&gt; I'VE HAD TO LEARN A LOT OF
INFORMATION REALLY QUICKLY.

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:32.619
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WITH NO ELECTION
TEAM IN PLACE, IT FELL TO THE

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:34.287
COUNTY CLERK, LINDSEY BROWN TO
SERVE.

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:37.056
&gt;&gt; PEOPLE THAT HAVE BEEN IN
ELECTIONS BEFORE, PEOPLE WHO

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:39.425
HAVE WORKED IT BEFORE HAVE
TAPPED INTO THEIR KNOWLEDGE AND

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:40.760
WISDOM.
&gt;&gt; I UNDERSTAND THE TEXAS

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.963
SECRETARY OF STATE'S OFFICE HAS
SENT IN ELECTION TRAINERS,

00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:48.334
SENDING IN INSPECTORS.
HOW VALUABLE OR HOW NEEDED HAVE

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:50.803
THOSE PEOPLE BEEN?
&gt;&gt; VERY VALUABLE.

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:56.175
&gt;&gt; JERRY IS A GEL LISS SPI
COUNTY DEMOCRAT WHO WILL WORK AS

00:02:56.175 --> 00:03:01.814
AN ALTERNATE PRECINCT JUDGE.
HE ATTENDED THE POLLING TRAINING

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:06.853
SESSION AND SAID WHAT HE HEARD
FROM THE ELECTION CONSPIRACY

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:08.755
THEORISTS TROUBLES HIM.
&gt;&gt; WHAT ARE WE SUPPOSED TO DO

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:13.026
WITH THE FAKE IDs THAT THE BIDEN
ADMINISTRATION IS ISSUING TO

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:15.828
ILLEGALS WHEN THEY TRAVEL ACROSS
THE BORDER.

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:18.264
THE SECRETARY OF STATE SAID --
REPRESENTATIVE SAID THAT'S NOT

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:22.201
HAPPENING, AND WE WENT ON.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: FOR NOW OFFICIALS

00:03:22.201 --> 00:03:25.271
ARE HOPING FOR THE BEST.
&gt;&gt; DO YOU FEEL CONFIDENT THIS

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:29.409
ELECTION WILL GO OFF SMOOTHLY?
&gt;&gt; YES, SIR.

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:32.612
&gt;&gt; Reporter: DON, THAT ELECTION
PRECINCT JUDGE YOU HEARD FROM,

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:36.582
HE BELIEVES IN 2020 THERE WERE
2,000 DONALD TRUMP VOTES FLIPPED

00:03:36.582 --> 00:03:40.086
FROM TRUMP TO BIDEN THERE IN
GILLESPIE COUNTY.

00:03:40.086 --> 00:03:47.360
THIS IS A LIE PEDALLED BY MY
PILLOW CEO MIKE LINDELL.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:51.964
FOR THE FIRST TIME IN MEMORY,
THEY'RE SENDING OUT ELECTION

00:03:51.964 --> 00:03:54.367
POLL WALKERS ON ELECTION DAY
TOMORROW.

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:55.468
&gt;&gt; ED LAVANDERA, THANK YOU.

